## Third-party components

Third-party work in this repo uses its own licence. That licence applies on top of the statement above.

- **Fonts.** Fredoka and Nunito are used under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Copies of the licence are in `assets/fonts/OFL-Fredoka.txt` and `assets/fonts/OFL-Nunito.txt`.
- **Audio.** Every sound file uses the licence recorded in `assets/audio/LICENSES.csv`. The source is Freesound under the CC0 licence, or your own recording marked `Milik sendiri` ("own work").
- **Dart and Flutter packages.** Every package in `pubspec.yaml`, including the packages that ship with Flutter, uses its own licence. The list can be opened with `fvm flutter pub deps`.

Questions about permission to use are sent to the repo owner.
